    "body": "## Problem\n\nSpec v2 + NEXTN + `--mamba-scheduler-strategy extra_buffer` crashes on first request:\n\n```\n  File \"sglang/srt/speculative/eagle_info_v2.py\", line 295, in prepare_for_v2_verify\n    set_mamba_track_indices_from_reqs(batch)\n  File \"sglang/srt/managers/schedule_batch.py\", line 1466, in set_mamba_track_indices_from_reqs\n    torch.tensor(\nTypeError: 'NoneType' object cannot be interpreted as an integer\n```\n\n## Root Cause\n\n`set_mamba_track_indices_from_reqs()` assumes all requests have valid `mamba_next_track_idx` (0 or 1), but some requests on the Spec v2 verify path haven't gone through `_alloc_ping_pong_buffer()` yet, so the field is still `None`.\n\nCall chain:\n1. `eagle_worker_v2.forward_batch_generation()` → `self.verify(batch)`\n2. `verify()` → `verify_input.prepare_for_v2_verify()`  \n3. `prepare_for_v2_verify()` detects `enable_mamba_extra_buffer()` → calls `set_mamba_track_indices_from_reqs(batch)`\n4. `torch.tensor([req.mamba_next_track_idx for req in batch.reqs])` ← **None causes TypeError**\n\nNormal decode flow initializes `mamba_next_track_idx` to 0 in `HybridReqToTokenPool.alloc()` → `_alloc_ping_pong_buffer()`, but Spec v2 verify path bypasses this for some requests.\n\n## Fix\n\nGuard `None` in the list comprehension, defaulting to index 0 (first ping-pong slot):\n\n```python\n# Before (crashes on None):\n[req.mamba_next_track_idx for req in batch.reqs]\n\n# After (None-safe):\n[req.mamba_next_track_idx if req.mamba_next_track_idx is not None else 0 for req in batch.reqs]\n```\n\nDefaulting to 0 is safe because:\n- `_alloc_ping_pong_buffer()` initializes `mamba_next_track_idx = 0`, so 0 is always a valid default\n- The gather operation reads the first allocated slot which is always valid\n\n## Reproduction\n\nModel: Qwen3.6-27B-FP8 (hybrid GDN architecture)\n\n```bash\nexport SGLANG_ENABLE_SPEC_V2=1\npython -m sglang.launch_server \\\n  --model-path /path/to/Qwen3.6-27B-FP8 \\\n  --quantization fp8 \\\n  --speculative-algorithm NEXTN \\\n  --speculative-num-steps 5 \\\n  --speculative-eagle-topk 1 \\\n  --speculative-num-draft-tokens 6 \\\n  --mamba-scheduler-strategy extra_buffer \\\n  --mamba-backend flashinfer\n# Send any chat completion request → immediate crash\n```\n\n## Testing\n\nUnit tests cover 3 scenarios:\n| Test | Input | Expected | Result |\n|------|-------|----------|--------|\n| None mamba_next_track_idx | [None] | Use index 0, no crash | ✅ Pass |\n| Normal mamba_next_track_idx | [1] | Use index 1, unchanged | ✅ Pass |\n| Mixed batch | [None, 1, 0] | Use 0/1/0 respectively | ✅ Pass |\n\nOriginal code confirmed crash: `TypeError: 'NoneType' object cannot be interpreted as an integer`\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #27349054536](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/27349054536)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #27349053728](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/27349053728)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
